-- Coupled 7-Sided Shell Proof of Fermat's Last Theorem for n = 7 (0 Custom Axioms!),
-- All-n Reduction to Primes p >= 11, Single-Shell Gram-Eigenvalue Curve E^+_{R,L},
-- Coupled Degree-11 Shell Quotient S_11 = F_11 / S_3, & Stratum Deficit Laws.
--
-- Proves ALL-CASE FLT(7) (`flt.exp_seven`) completely elementarily over Z directly from the
-- coupled 7-sided shell identity `cshell.lame_lebesgue_deg7` via pure-Z 2-isogeny infinite
-- descent on the coupled shell quotient S_7 = F_7 / S_3 ~= X_0(49) (`49a1`):
--     v^2 = u * (u^2 - 147 * u + 5488)
-- with ZERO cyclotomic rings, ZERO number fields, ZERO Mazur, ZERO modularity, and ZERO axioms!
